 field to navigate too.\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"A map and a compass are often helpful for long trips.\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"They fly thousands of miles from one home to another.\"}, {\"key\": \"E\", \"text\": \"They learn the route that the older geese have traveled before.\"}, {\"key\": \"F\", \"text\": \"They have answered many questions about how birds navigate.\"}]','E',NULL,'幼鸟跟着父母,学习长辈走过的路线。',2,'2026年4月英语(专升本)真题',2026,2.0,'DRAFT',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-16 07:54:55','2026-10-16 07:54:55'),(188,4,13,'SENTENCE_FILL','【原文 · Bird Maps and Compasses】\n___ Chemicals in their brains allow them to sense the magnetic field and travel in the right direction.\n\n第 30 空应填入:','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"The bands contained a name and address.\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"Birds use the earth\'s magnetic field to navigate too.\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"A map and a compass are often helpful for long trips.\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"They fly thousands of miles from one home to another.\"}, {\"key\": \"E\", \"text\": \"They learn the route that the older geese have traveled before.\"}, {\"key\": \"F\", \"text\": \"They have answered many questions about how birds navigate.\"}]','B',NULL,'空格后讲磁场感应,承接「鸟类也利用地磁场导航」。',2,'2026年4月英语(专升本)真题',2026,2.0,'DRAFT',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-16 07:54:55','2026-10-16 07:54:55'),(189,4,14,'WORD_FILL','【原文 · My Hometown and My College Town】\nMy hometown and my college town have several things in common. First, both are ___ communities. My hometown, Gridlock, has a population of only about 10,000 people.\n\n第 31 空应填入:','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"consists\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"mainly\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"attending\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"clear\"}, {\"key\": \"E\", \"text\": \"small\"}, {\"key\": \"F\", \"text\": \"center\"}, {\"key\": \"G\", \"text\": \"hardly\"}, {\"key\": \"H\", \"text\": \"beautiful\"}, {\"key\": \"I\", \"text\": \"raise\"}, {\"key\": \"J\", \"text\": \"known\"}, {