 \"A\", \"text\": \"enjoy yourself\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"know its benefits\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"discipline yourself\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"record your changes\"}]','C',NULL,'根据文章第四段第一句 \'To get results at home, you need self-motivation and discipline...\' 可知，需要自律。',2,'英语二1',NULL,2.0,'DRAFT',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 19:18:59','2026-10-18 19:18:59'),(1082,4,NULL,'READING_CHOICE','【原文 · Exercise at Home】Home exercise is the new phenomenon in fitness. It\'s easy to see why more and more people are taking interest in home exercise.\n\nAll it takes to get results at home is an exercise mat, and some free weights. Even if you don\'t have these tools, there are several kinds of exercise you can do around the house. You can always try the exercise that uses your own body weight. The secret to success is to exercise the right way without hurting yourself.\n\nAt home, you can train at your own time. You are not affected by the timings of your gym or your trainer. This is an excellent solution for stay-at-home moms, and those individuals who work from home or have an irregular work schedule. With the number of tools available today, it is simple to set up a gym atmosphere in the comfort of your own home.\n\nTo get results at home, you need self-motivation and discipline, since you\'re going to be on your own. It\'s not as hard as you think and can be enjoyable and beneficial. When you are committed mentally to pursuing a leaner, energized and dynamic fitness level, changes happen much faster.\n\nThere\'re some other advantages home exercise has over a health club. After all, a club is a social institution. If one gets there to socialize more, he will exercise less. A club could also be crowded. Many people may wait in line for the equipment. With home exercise, there\'s no waiting period. So, many individuals are now exercising at home. In fact, as a recent study says, exercising at home is just as beneficial as working out at a health club. It also found that people who trained at home were more likely to stick with their program than those who exercised at a club.\n\n14. People who go to health clubs are likely to ______.','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"stick with their favorite programs\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"make better use of gym equipment\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"reap more gains from the training\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"spend much time making friends\"}]','D',NULL,'根据文章最后一段 \'After all, a club is a social institution. If one gets there to socialize more, he will exercise less.\' 可知，去健身俱乐部的人可能会花很多时间社交（交朋友）。',2,'英语二1',NULL,2.0,'DRAFT',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 19:18:59','2026-10-18 19:18:59'),(1083,4,NULL,'READING_CHOICE','【原文 · Exercise at Home】Home exercise is the new phenomenon in fitness. It\'s easy to see why more and more people are taking interest in home exercise.\n\nAll it takes to get results at home is an exercise mat, and some free weights. Even if you don\'t have these tools, there are several kinds of exercise you can do around the house. You can always try the exercise that uses your own body weight. The secret to success is to exercise the right way without hurting yourself.\n\nAt home, you can train at your own time. You are not affected by the timings of your gym or your trainer. This is an excellent solution for stay-at-home moms, and those individuals who work from home or have an irregular work schedule. With the number of tools available today, it is simple to set up a gym atmosphere in the comfort of your own home.\n\nTo get results at home, you need self-motivation and discipline, since you\'re going to be on your own. It\'s not as hard as you think and can be enjoyable and beneficial. When you are committed mentally to pursuing a leaner, energized and dynamic fitness level, changes happen much faster.\n\nThere\'re some other advantages home exercise has over a health club. After all, a club is a social institution. If one gets there to socialize more, he will exercise less. A club could also be crowded. Many people may wait in line for the equipment. With home exercise, there\'s no waiting period. So, many individuals are now exercising at home. In fact, as a recent study says, exercising at home is just as beneficial as working out at a health club. It also found that people who trained at home were more likely to stick with their program than those who exercised at a club.\n\n15. This passage mainly talks about ______.','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"types of home exercise\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"advantages of home exercise\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"ways to do home exercise\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"people fit for home exercise\"}]','B',NULL,'通读全文，文章主要介绍了在家锻炼的好处（如工具少、时间灵活、无需等待设备等），故选 B。',2,'英语二1',NULL,2.0,'DRAFT',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 19:18:59','2026-10-18 19:18:59'),(1084,4,NULL,'SECTION_MATCH','【原文 · Secrets About Professional Chocolate Tasters】\n❶ People\'s faces light up when I say taste chocolate for a living, but it\'s not always delicious. I also have to taste bad chocolate. I\'m usually in a small room and sit in front of a computer to record information. Sometimes the room has red lighting. So I can evaluate chocolate only by taste, not appearance.\n\nParagraph ❶:','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"How I keep a good sense of taste.\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"You can taste chocolate like a professional.\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"Tasting chocolate requires skills.\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"Tasting chocolate is not as sweet as you think.\"}, {\"key\": \"E\", \"text\": \"Tasting chocolate is the best job ever.\"}, {\"key\": \"F\", \"text\": \"I\'m still a chocolate lover.\"}]','D',NULL,'第一段提到品尝巧克力并不总是美味的（not always delicious），还要品尝坏的巧克力，这与选项 D “Tasting chocolate is not as sweet as you think”（品尝巧克力不像你想的那么甜蜜）相符。',2,'英语二1',NULL,2.0,'DRAFT',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 19:18:59','2026-10-18 19:18:59'),(1085,4,NULL,'SECTION_MATCH','【原文 · Secrets About Professional Chocolate Tasters】\n❷ I can sample as many as 30 chocolates per day. To taste them professionally, I spit the sweets back out. That\'s another not-so-sweet part of the job. Between samples, I wait 30 seconds to let my senses rest, and I chew half an unsalted biscuit and drink plain warm water.\n\nParagraph ❷:','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"How I keep a good sense of taste.\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"You can taste chocolate like a professional.\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"Tasting chocolate requires skills.\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"Tasting chocolate is not as sweet as you think.\"}, {\"key\": \"E\", \"text\": \"Tasting chocolate is the best job ever.\"}, {\"key\": \"F\", \"text\": \"I\'m still a chocolate lover.\"}]','A',NULL,'第二段描述了作者如何在两次品尝之间休息感官、吃饼干和喝水，这是为了保持味觉灵敏的方法，对应选项 A “How I keep a good sense of taste”。',2,'英语二1',NULL,2.0,'DRAFT',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 19:18:59','2026-10-18 19:18:59'),(1086,4,NULL,'SECTION_MATCH','【原文 · Secrets About Professional Chocolate Tasters】\n❸ First I smell the chocolate and record it. I also listen; Old chocolate doesn\'t make a clear and sharp sound when broken. Then I put a tiny piece in my mouth and leave it there for a few seconds. I let it melt and record the four basic tastes—sweet, sour, bitter and salty.\n\nParagraph ❸:','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"How I keep a good sense of taste.\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"You can taste chocolate like a professional.\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"Tasting chocolate requires skills.\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"Tasting chocolate is not as sweet as you think.\"}, {\"key\": \"E\", \"text\": \"Tasting chocolate is the best job ever.\"}, {\"key\": \"F\", \"text\": \"I\'m still a chocolate lover.\"}]','C',NULL,'第三段详细描述了闻、听、尝等一系列专业步骤，说明品尝巧克力需要技巧，对应选项 C “Tasting chocolate requires skills”。',2,'英语二1',NULL,2.0,'DRAFT',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 19:18:59','2026-10-18 19:18:59'),(1087,4,NULL,'SECTION_MATCH','【原文 · Secrets About Professional Chocolate Tasters】\n❹ I love chocolate. The bottom part of my refrigerator is filled with chocolate from different parts of the world. My favorite types are very high in cocoa (可可粉). Before I started tasting chocolate professionally, I ate a lot. But now I don\'t eat so much.\n\nParagraph ❹:','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"How I keep a good sense of taste.\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"You can taste chocolate like a professional.\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"Tasting chocolate requires skills.\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"Tasting chocolate is not as sweet as you think.\"}, {\"key\": \"E\", \"text\": \"Tasting chocolate is the best job ever.\"}, {\"key\": \"F\", \"text\": \"I\'m still a chocolate lover.\"}]','F',NULL,'第四段开头就说“I love chocolate”，并描述了自己收藏各种巧克力的情况，对应选项 F “I\'m still a chocolate lover”。',1,'英语二1',NULL,2.0,'DRAFT',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 19:18:59','2026-10-18 19:18:59'),(1088,4,NULL,'SECTION_MATCH','【原文 · Secrets About Professional Chocolate Tasters】\n❺ Many people don\'t know how to appreciate the taste of chocolate. As a taster, I want to help others do what I do. To retrain your taste buds to enjoy better quality chocolate, try simple kinds that aren\'t filled with ingredients like nuts. Look at food with curiosity and love. Notice its color, smell and taste. Then you\'ll know good quality.\n\nParagraph ❺:','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"How I keep a good sense of taste.\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"You can taste chocolate like a professional.\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"Tasting chocolate requires skills.\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"Tasting chocolate is not as sweet as you think.\"}, {\"key\": \"E\", \"text\": \"Tasting chocolate is the best job ever.\"}, {\"key\": \"F\", \"text\": \"I\'m still a chocolate lover.\"}]','B',NULL,'第五段作者建议读者如何像专业人士一样去欣赏和品尝巧克力（retrain your taste buds...），对应选项 B “You can taste chocolate like a professional”。',2,'英语二1',NULL,2.0,'DRAFT',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 19:18:59','2026-10-18 19:18:59'),(1089,4,NULL,'SENTENCE_FILL','Red lights are used to disguise __(21)__.','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"is old or fresh\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"is made of cocoa\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"your tasting\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"after I taste each sample\"}, {\"key\": \"E\", \"text\": \"before I became taster\"}, {\"key\": \"F\", \"text\": \"the appearance of chocolate\"}]','F',NULL,'根据第一段“Sometimes the room has red lighting. So I can evaluate chocolate only by taste, not appearance.”可知红光用于掩盖外观。',2,'英语二1',NULL,2.0,'DRAFT',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 19:18:59','2026-10-18 19:18:59'),(1090,4,NULL,'SENTENCE_FILL','I let my senses rest __(22)__.','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"is old or fresh\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"is made of cocoa\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"your tasting\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"after I taste each sample\"}, {\"key\": \"E\", \"text\": \"before I became taster\"}, {\"key\": \"F\", \"text\": \"the appearance of chocolate\"}]','D',NULL,'根据第二段“Between samples, I wait 30 seconds to let my senses rest...”可知是在每次品尝样品之后。',2,'英语二1',NULL,2.0,'DRAFT',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 19:18:59','2026-10-18 19:18:59'),(1091,4,NULL,'SENTENCE_FILL','I listen to tell whether a sample __(23)__.','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"is old or fresh\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"is made of cocoa\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"your tasting\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"after I taste each sample\"}, {\"key\": \"E\", \"text\": \"before I became taster\"}, {\"key\": \"F\", \"text\": \"the appearance of chocolate\"}]','A',NULL,'根据第三段“I also listen; Old chocolate doesn\'t make a clear and sharp sound when broken.”可知通过声音判断是旧的还是新鲜的。',2,'英语二1',NULL,2.0,'DRAFT',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 19:18:59','2026-10-18 19:18:59'),(1092,4,NULL,'SENTENCE_FILL','I ate a lot of chocolate __(24)__.','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"is old or fresh\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"is made of cocoa\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"your tasting\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"after I taste each sample\"}, {\"key\": \"E\", \"text\": \"before I became taster\"}, {\"key\": \"F\", \"text\": \"the appearance of chocolate\"}]','E',NULL,'根据第四段“Before I started tasting chocolate professionally, I ate a lot.”可知是在成为品鉴师之前。',1,'英语二1',NULL,2.0,'DRAFT',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 19:18:59','2026-10-18 19:18:59'),(1093,4,NULL,'SENTENCE_FILL','Ingredients like nuts may affect __(25)__.','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"is old or fresh\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"is made of cocoa\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"your tasting\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"after I taste each sample\"}, {\"key\": \"E\", \"text\": \"before I became taster\"}, {\"key\": \"F\", \"text\": \"the appearance of chocolate\"}]','C',NULL,'根据第五段“try simple kinds that aren\'t filled with ingredients like nuts”以及上下文关于重新训练味蕾的内容，暗示坚果等配料会影响你的品尝体验。',2,'英语二1',NULL,2.0,'DRAFT',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 19:18:59','2026-10-18 19:18:59'),(1094,4,NULL,'SENTENCE_FILL','【原文 · How to Shoot a Movie】A movie is a series of pictures. Each image is a still picture, just like a picture you take with a regular camera. But the pictures flash by so fast in a movie. As a result, you see horses run, people talk, and other kinds of motion. __(26)__ Movies are also called films because they are filmed.\n\nLots of work has to be done before the filming begins. The producer and the director plan how and when they will film each scene.\n\nA movie is filmed scene by scene. __ The scenes are not usually filmed in the order you see in the movie. Sometimes the weather is bad and an outdoor scene cannot be filmed. Big fancy sets take a long time to build. Scenes using these sets are often shot later. However, you may see them at the beginning of the film.\n\nSometimes a movie needs special effects. They include small models of huge scenes and cleverly designed sets. __ Moviemakers use these to film scenes and places that do not exist. They might use a small model of a large building to film the building falling down.\n\nFilms can be turned into computer files. __ They can use computers to make new images. For example, dinosaurs(恐龙) made by computer looked like they were flying in some films.\n\n__ Many images in Titanic, including crowds of people on the ship, were actually made by computer. In some other films, computers were used to make the actors look as if they were fighting while floating in the air.','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"And a scene is filmed shot by shot.\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"Computers can even make images of actors.\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"Moviemaking includes several different stages.\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"They also include computer-made images.\"}, {\"key\": \"E\", \"text\": \"That\'s why movies are sometimes called motion pictures.\"}, {\"key\": \"F\", \"text\": \"Moviemakers can then change the images any way they want.\"}]','E',NULL,'前文提到电影画面快速闪过让人看到动作（motion），后文解释为什么叫film。选项E“这就是为什么电影有时被称为motion pictures”承上启下，符合语境。',1,'英语二1',NULL,2.0,'DRAFT',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 19:18:59','2026-10-18 19:18:59'),(1095,4,NULL,'SENTENCE_FILL','【原文 · How to Shoot a Movie】A movie is a series of pictures. Each image is a still picture, just like a picture you take with a regular camera. But the pictures flash by so fast in a movie. As a result, you see horses run, people talk, and other kinds of motion. __ Movies are also called films because they are filmed.\n\nLots of work has to be done before the filming begins. The producer and the director plan how and when they will film each scene.\n\nA movie is filmed scene by scene. __(27)__ The scenes are not usually filmed in the order you see in the movie. Sometimes the weather is bad and an outdoor scene cannot be filmed. Big fancy sets take a long time to build. Scenes using these sets are often shot later. However, you may see them at the beginning of the film.\n\nSometimes a movie needs special effects. They include small models of huge scenes and cleverly designed sets. __ Moviemakers use these to film scenes and places that do not exist. They might use a small model of